to `FileProxy` in `rich/file_proxy.py`.\n\n```python\n    def isatty(self) -> bool:\n        return getattr(self.__file, \"isatty\", lambda: False)()\n```\nThis delegates the call to `self.__file.isatty()` if it exists, otherwise it defaults to `False`.\n\nLet's apply the fix.\n\nfilepath:<|\"|>rich/file_proxy.py<|\"|>,old_string:<|\"|>    def fileno(self) -> int:\n        return self.__file.fileno()<|\"|>,new_string:<|\"|>    def fileno(self) -> int:\n        return self.__file.fileno()\n\n    def isatty(self) -> bool:\n        return getattr(self.__file, \"isatty\", lambda: False)()<|\"|>,allow_multiple:false<channel|>", "error_code": null, "error_message": null}
